SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7
    units mol/kgw
    Ca 0.01
    Sr 0.01
    Alkalinity 0.04

SOLID_SOLUTIONS 1
    Ca_Sr_carbonate
        -comp1 Calcite 0.0
        -comp2 Strontianite 0.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings a_Ca
    10 PUNCH ACT("Ca+2")
END
